  "description": "Reserved development unit pool. Committed before any development query is written, per the dev/test firewall. Units here are burned from pre-registered gold eligibility; the test-set builder asserts no gold unit is drawn from this pool. Unit = parent_id. Because retrieval parameters are locked untuned, the dev set's job is catching structural breakage, so the pool covers every structural stratum.",
